+## Determination and uncertainty
+
+**No.** There is no fresh, independently checkable post-deployment Act 19
+threshold-recovery episode showing an affected office resumed useful work.
+The exact fix identified in the issue is not deployed; the deployed recorder
+has event identity, threshold/cooldown/progress and no-duplicate semantics in
+source and passing hermetic tests, and one fresh single-failure episode
+demonstrates idempotent recording plus a single safe replacement — but it
+never reached the threshold, and its successor performed zero prompts and no
+work. The only threshold episodes on record are from 2026-11-03 and are not
+fresh relative to the 2026-11-24 claim or current main.
